    description: You found a dried-up oasis outpost, once a thriving desert trading
      hub built around a deep well, now reduced to a circle of sun-bleached adobe
      buildings and dead palm trees half-choked by the dunes.
    guardArmyName: 
    rewards:
    - type: 0
      resources:
        human: 2
        energy: 0
