  - name: Solar farm
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b8125e3b9e589a2438d6e66d8c80f7e8, type: 3}
    description: You found an abandoned solar farm stretching across miles of flat
      desert, where tens of thousands of massive, black photovoltaic mirrors face
      the sky like a silent, dead army.
    guardArmyName: 
    rewards:
    - type: 0
      resources:
        human: 0
