  - name: Crashed cargo blimp
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d3d2a7273506a574da64907964c0f68e, type: 3}
    description: You found a crashed cargo blimp, a massive pre-war luxury airship
      that deflated and draped its colossal, sun-bleached fabric hull over a cluster
