  - name: Orbital satellite
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e110a89a93bed9345a939fd80bd2d6aa, type: 3}
    description: You found a crashed orbital satellite that plummeted from the sky
      years ago, carving a massive scar through the desert dunes and now resting
