      The heavy steel blast doors have been breached by past artillery fire, opening
      a path into the shadowy, cavernous assembly floor.
    guardArmyName: 
    rewards:
    - type: 0
      resources:
        human: 1
        energy: 1
        materials: 2
        tech: 1
